config MT6630S
	tristate "MediaTek MT6630 (SDIO) support"
	select MT76_CORE
	select MT76_SDIO
	depends on MAC80211
	depends on MMC
	imply BT_MTKSDIO
	help
	  This adds support for the WLAN function of the MediaTek MT6630
	  combo chip on SDIO. The chip's Bluetooth function loads the ROM
	  patch the WLAN firmware needs, so the WLAN function waits for
	  BT_MTKSDIO to bind first.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.
